# Skills, design assets, generated contracts and reviewed migration files have
# byte-level SHA256 provenance. Preserve their original bytes on every platform.
* -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
# Preserve exact raw acceptance records, including their original whitespace.
tracking/evidence/** -whitespace
# PDF xref rows contain significant trailing spaces; inspect the original bytes
# with the document tools rather than applying text whitespace fixes.
fixtures/live-specs-files/*.pdf binary
fixtures/live-specs-files/*.docx binary
